sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant S as Dispatcher
  participant Q as JBMQ
  participant A as Parent API
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  S->>Q: Get request reference
  Q-->>S: Job ID
  S->>A: Accept execution
  activate A
  A->>D: Commit READY
  D-->>A: READY committed
  A-->>S: Accepted / existing
  deactivate A
  S->>Q: ACK request message
  Note over S,D: Lost responses reuse the same job ID.<br/>Duplicate delivery does not repeat execution.
